t in between the  layers of the screen and drive someone  insane and if it's already sealed up  then we'd have to open it up and do  about an hour of cleaning so we have to  be very careful  i used the clamps to secure everything  together  so i can restore the original airtight  seal  normally i would have to leave them on  for days but thankfully since i used a  few drops of super glue i only have to  leave it in for 20 minutes  [Music]  this specific repair took a lot more  work than your average ipad repair and  i'm just grateful that we were able to  bring it back to life  [Music]
 

